			<div class="content" id="post-content-1896922">
									

<p>I'll explain. It is a giraffe that writes. What the giraffe writes is not important or interesting in any way. What the foundation is so interested in, is the fact that it is a writing giraffe.</p>
<p>The idea of the article is to make the reader believe the stuff it writes is important or interesting throughout because that is the way the giraffe describes it. What the giraffe doesn't understand is why they find its writing so interesting. That fact that the author is a giraffe, is revealed at the end to explain why they find its writing so interesting.</p>
<p>The author doesn't understand that it is weird to be a giraffe with the ability to write fluently in english and have a general comprehension of human related affairs. However the foundation does and that is why they aren't letting him go.</p>

